  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Born in the radioactive slush of the Subchain City's forgotten loading docks, 'Sparky' was a scrapper from hatchling. One fateful day, while raiding a Cryo-Tech facility, he stumbled upon a pair of Shock-Goggles and a controller caked in something that certainly *looked* like blood. Now, he sees more than anyone else, both literally and figuratively.",
