    "name": "Sparky 'Starburst' Hayes",
    "personality": "Paranoid but brilliant, Sparky is always jittery from the cryo-tech leaking from his hacked goggles. He trusts no one, except maybe his trusty, blood-stained controller; He's pretty sure it's got his back better than most of the other ducks he's met.",
